  "interpretation": [
    "On this consumed four-road development set, increasing model-only updates from 64 to 256 did not make either teacher-trained world model beat shifted-repeat image prediction on either source stratum; both teacher seeds worsened on both strata.",
    "Image/reward MSE and terminal BCE are internal proxies, not driving or competition scores; the four independent terminal events and zero independent finish positives preclude finish-event conclusions.",
    "A negative update-budget sensitivity here does not identify the cause or prove that longer training generally fails. No further unregistered update escalation or student actor training is justified by this result.",
